@* 權限判定完成前不渲染任何內容，否則沒有權限的人會先看到頁面框架（PageAuthorizationTests 守門）。 *@
@if (!isAccessChecked)
{
}
else if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(RoleMessage) == false)
{
    <div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">
        @RoleMessage
    </div>
}
else
{
    <section class="home-welcome" aria-label="系統介紹">
        <div class="home-hero">
            <div class="home-hero-image-wrap">
                <img class="home-hero-image"
                     src="@Assets["images/brand-logo.png"]"
                     alt="系統品牌圖示" />
            </div>

            <div class="home-hero-copy">
                <p class="home-eyebrow">Welcome</p>
                <h1 class="home-title">@SystemName</h1>
                <p class="home-description">@SystemDescription</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="home-section">
            <h2 class="home-section-title">系統能力</h2>
            <div class="home-feature-grid">
                @foreach (var feature in FeatureCards)
                {
                    <article class="home-feature-card">
                        <span class="home-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                            <MaterialIcon Theme="@MaterialIcon.Themes.Outlined" Kind="@feature.Icon" />
                        </span>
                        <h3 class="home-feature-title">@feature.Title</h3>
                        <p class="home-feature-description">@feature.Description</p>
                    </article>
                }
            </div>
        </div>

        @if (quickLinks.Count > 0)
        {
            <div class="home-section">
                <h2 class="home-section-title">快速入口</h2>
                <div class="home-quick-links">
                    @foreach (var link in quickLinks)
                    {
                        <a class="home-quick-link" href="@link.Url">
                            <span class="home-quick-link-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                <MaterialIcon Theme="@MaterialIcon.Themes.Outlined" Kind="@link.Icon" />
                            </span>
                            <span class="home-quick-link-title">@link.Title</span>
                        </a>
                    }
                </div>
            </div>
        }

        <dl class="home-meta">
            <div class="home-meta-item">
                <dt>系統版本</dt>
                <dd>@SystemVersion</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="home-meta-item">
                <dt>執行環境</dt>
                <dd>@WebHostEnvironment.EnvironmentName</dd>
            </div>
        </dl>
    </section>
}
